* `sed` - Stream editor used to modify text[span_2](start_span)[span_2](end_span)
* `-i` - Modifies the file directly[span_3](start_span)[span_3](end_span)
* `^` - Indicates the beginning of a line[span_4](start_span)[span_4](end_span)
* `\([^ ]*\)` - Matches and stores the first word[span_5](start_span)[span_5](end_span)
* `\([^ ]*\)` - Matches and stores the second word[span_6](start_span)[span_6](end_span)
* `\2 \1` - Reverses their order, putting the second part first[span_7](start_span)[span_7](end_span)
* `name.txt` - Input text file[span_8](start_span)[span_8](end_span)

